    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23001" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĭn-ēnarrābĭlis</span></b> ,
			e, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that cannot be related</i> or <i>described</i>, <i>indescribable</i>
			(mostly post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mira quadam et incredibili atque inenarrabili
					pietate,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					2, 99, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">labor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					44, 5, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tabes (jecoris),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					41, 15, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">natura fluminum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 3, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ratio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 11, 3, 177</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">habitus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 7, 7, § 21</span></i>
			.</div>
